{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn8le03ob02re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Computer Viruses</span><br /><br />\nA computer virus is a computer program that invades a computer and often causes unwanted or undesirable things to happen. Different viruses enter and infect computers in different ways, with each successive generation getting smarter and harder to detect and destroy. Computer viruses can do terrible damage. They can erase all the files that you have saved on a hard drive, make files useless by changing them, and even hijack your computer so it can be used for illegal purposes.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "Computer viruses are considered to be one of the major problems of our century. They cause billions of dollars in damage and lost revenue annually in the US alone and this figure is expected to rise in the future. One survey found viruses roaming the Internet had infected 98% of North American businesses. Most of these businesses are linked to the Internet, which makes it even easier to spread the viruses.", "time": "32500", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<p>The US government takes computer virus crimes very seriously. Suspects accused of computer crimes are investigated and put on trial according to the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act, which lawmakers changed when computer crimes had increased.</p>\n<p>For those who had intentionally caused damage by transmitting viruses, the punishment could be a stiff prison term plus a fine.</p>", "time": "57500", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I c